  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 13.655 + 0.168 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.399 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=13.655\\times10^{-3}T+0.084\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+1.399\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-4.548$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 27.689 + 0.720 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 1.963 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 89.000 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 27.689 - 0.720 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 1.963 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 44.500 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 1.786 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 26.422 - 2.278 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.236 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 71.600 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = 26.422 + 2.278 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.236 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 35.800 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 19.309 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSource: Data from Gurvich (50). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase change: 933.61 K, melting point of Al; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 2.580$ kcal/mol",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 13.655 + 0.168 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.399 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=13.655\\times10^{-3}T+0.084\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+1.399\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-4.548$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-933.61 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 27.689 + 0.720 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 1.963 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 89.000 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 27.689 - 0.720 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 1.963 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 44.500 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 1.786 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "933.61-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 26.422 - 2.278 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.236 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 71.600 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = 26.422 + 2.278 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.236 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 35.800 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 19.309 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "Source: Data from Gurvich (50)."
